  "title": "Tentative Schedule",
  "body": " Tentative Schedule  Below is a tentative schedule for what topics will be covered when.   Week 1  Introduction and Expectations, Sets and Logic ( )    Week 2  Logic, Connecting Elements, Properties of Relations ( )    Week 3  Equivalence Relations, Integers and Rationals, Remainders and Modulo ( )    Week 4  Remainders and Modulo, Functions ( )    Week 5  Functions, Bijections and Inverses, Counting and Cardinality, Sequences ( )    Week 6  Recursion, Monotone and Bounded Sequences, Convergence, Limits, Bounds and ( )    Week 7  Series, Review ( )    Week 8  Review, Midterm 1, Limits and Continuity ( )    Week 9  Derivatives ( )    Week 10  Derivative Rules, Higher Derivatives, Describing Functions ( )    Week 11  Optimization, Newton's Method, Indefinite Limits, Complexity ( )    Week 12  Taylor Polynomials and Series, Solving Recursions, Review ( )    Week 13  Review, Midterm 2, Integration, Antiderivatives ( )    Fall Recess      Week 14  Review, Integration Techniques, Definite Integrals( )    Week 15  The Fundamental Theorem of Calculus, Cumulative Review ( )    Finals Week       "
